# Version: 0.1.0 | 2026-11-02
Fixture conventions

lint_blocklist.txt is UTF-8, with one forbidden lexeme per non-comment line.
Blank lines and lines beginning with # are ignored. Preserved-string exceptions
are handled by the Phase 1 content loader, not by this fixture.
The six C-8 terms are normative; the missing C-9 list is tracked in
../../docs/implementation_status.md.

conftest.py isolates CRADLE_HOME (saves/, backups/, logs/) per test and provides
explicit seed and seeds fixtures. No fixture constructs game state. From WP-3.2,
state setup must dispatch production commands through tests/harness.py.
